.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/fa8546c88b99b37973db24eb454518c151212142-123x48.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Wellington Management\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/806c8d74ac52be47dbb747b8752e9ce9bbd82f8a-185x48.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Sui\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/c337837dace6c3a7e856fbd3905e44681287fb28-85x48.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Franklin Templeton\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/9bf26bcf5b275a431b6247e9e87203c0b42e4901-147x48.svg\"}]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:T1614,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"* This pilot demonstrates coordination between public blockchain infrastructure and interbank settlement rails.\n* Milestone establishes a framework for 24/7, near real-time cross-border settlement across global banks using Ondo tokenized assets.\n* The XRP Ledger processed the asset leg of the transaction in under five seconds, supporting institutional-grade tokenized asset infrastructure operating globally and around the clock.\n\n[Ondo Finance](https://ondo.finance/) has successfully completed the first near real-time cross-border, cross-bank redemption of a tokenized U.S. Treasury fund. The pilot was conducted in collaboration with [Kinexys by J.P. Morgan](https://www.jpmorgan.com/kinexys/index), [Mastercard](https://www.mastercard.com/), and [Ripple](https://ripple.com/). This establishes a framework for 24/7, near real-time cross-border settlement across global banks for tokenized asset redemption.\n\nAs part of the pilot, Ripple redeemed tokenized assets issued on the XRP Ledger (XRPL), a public blockchain. The associated fiat settlement was triggered via the [Mastercard Multi-Token Network (MTN)](https://www.mastercard.com/us/en/business/payments/consumer-payments/next-gen-payments/digital-asset-solutions/multi-token-network.html), which enables interoperability between different forms of value and allows traditional financial institutions to interact with onchain commerce. Fiat settlement execution was initiated on Kinexys by J.P. Morgan’s blockchain infrastructure, which also supported onward instruction to J.P. Morgan’s correspondent banking network for cross-border delivery of funds. \n\nThe transaction represents a redemption of a tokenized treasury asset executed in near real-time, outside traditional cut-off windows, paired with cross-border transfer of funds triggered on blockchain infrastructure. One leg of the transaction occurred on a public blockchain, while the other settled on bank infrastructure. This is the first transaction of its kind between global financial institutions. \n\n## Connecting Public Blockchains with Global Bank Infrastructure\nAs part of the pilot, Ripple redeemed a portion of its Ondo Short-Term U.S. Government Treasuries (OUSG) holdings on XRPL. Ondo processed the redemption and initiated a fiat payout instruction via the Mastercard MTN, which routed the instruction to Kinexys by J.P. Morgan. Kinexys debited Ondo’s Blockchain Deposit Account and settled U.S. dollar proceeds to Ripple’s bank account in Singapore via its correspondent banking network.\n\nWhile tokenized real-world assets have grown significantly, redemption infrastructure has largely remained dependent on traditional wire systems, manual processes, and limited operating hours. This pilot demonstrates an integrated model in which blockchain-based asset redemption can trigger settlement without the need for siloed traditional infrastructures to initiate payment settlement.\n\nThe result is a unified transaction flow in which blockchain execution and traditional bank settlement operate in concert rather than requiring separate instructions.\n\n\u003e “This milestone represents the first time tokenized U.S. Treasuries have settled across borders and banks in near real time and outside traditional banking windows,” said Ian De Bode, President of Ondo Finance. “By connecting public blockchain infrastructure with interbank settlement rails, Ondo, Kinexys by J.P. Morgan, Mastercard, and Ripple are laying the groundwork for 24/7 global markets that never close.”\n\n\u003e “This marks a meaningful step forward in demonstrating that tokenized assets can move seamlessly between public blockchain infrastructure and the global financial system,” said Markus Infanger, SVP of RippleX. “The XRP Ledger enables real-time asset movement, and when paired with global banking infrastructure, this pilot shows how institutions can execute cross-border transactions as a single, integrated flow.”\n\n\u003e Zack Chestnut, Global Head of Commercialization at Kinexys by J.P. Morgan, said, “This pilot is an important step towards establishing a framework for institutional-scale tokenized asset markets. To see widespread adoption of tokenized financial products, we need wholesale cross-industry collaboration across geographies, global banking infrastructure and public blockchains. We’re excited to continue working with Ondo, Ripple and Mastercard to bring this to life.”\n\n\u003e “As tokenized assets continue to see strong institutional momentum and engagement, the focus is quickly shifting to how tokenized commerce can operate at scale in real time,” said Raj Dhamodharan, executive vice president, Blockchain and Digital Assets at Mastercard. “With the Mastercard Multi‑Token Network, we’re enabling near real‑time, cross‑border settlement using existing bank accounts—bringing coordination, trust, and interoperability to institutional on‑chain flows.”\n\n## Advancing 24/7, Multi-Bank, Cross-Border Settlement\nFor tokenized financial products to operate at institutional scale, settlement infrastructure must function across banks and geographies outside traditional operating windows. This pilot demonstrates a practical framework for continuous, real-time coordination between transacting parties on public blockchains and global banking infrastructure.\n\nThe architecture framework is designed to support redemptions from any public blockchain on which OUSG is issued, including XRPL, providing a model for how Ondo tokenized assets can integrate with financial networks.\n\n![](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/7d28a17f74efdfedc487e963af91ff0e78be9bf5-1600x979.png)"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:Tcd8,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Ondo has partnered with [Broadridge Financial Solutions](https://www.broadridge.com/), which settles over $15 trillion in securities daily, to enable holders of tokenized stocks and ETFs to submit voting preferences for underlying shares.\n\nBroadridge is the leading provider of investor communications and technology solutions, serving over 10,000 public companies as critical infrastructure connecting issuers and investors across the global financial system.\n\nThrough this integration, holders of more than 250 Ondo tokenized stocks and ETFs will be able to indicate voting preferences and review prospectuses, regulatory filings, and other governance information for underlying securities through Broadridge’s established investor communications infrastructure.\n\nRecommendations will be weighted proportionately based on token ownership, with Ondo facilitating the attribution of voting recommendations from tokenholders to specific stock. Broadridge will provide token holders with the corresponding investor communications and with [Ondo Stocks](https://ondo.finance/ondo-stocks)’ consent, aggregate their vote preferences alongside the votes of traditional market participants.\n\nThe partnership reflects Ondo’s core design goal: tokenized stocks should meet the standards of traditional markets to the fullest possible extent, while also adding unique accessibility benefits. By unlocking voting capabilities for holders of freely transferable onchain tokens that can trade 24/7, Ondo further bridges traditional market structure with blockchain-native infrastructure. \n\n\u003e “This is about expanding what it means to hold a tokenized stock,” said Matthieu de Vergnes, MD, Global Head of Institutional at Ondo Finance. “By working with Broadridge, we are enabling holders of our onchain wrapper stocks to access governance and voting capabilities like holders of the traditional offchain stocks, with all the additional benefits onchain wrapper tokens provide.”\n\n\u003e “Today’s announcement represents a major milestone in the evolution of tokenized equities and ETFs. Broadridge is proud to expand its voting infrastructure to connect our new Web3-enabled platform with the governance, disclosure, and investor participation standards that underpin modern capital markets,” said Doug DeSchutter, President, Investor Communication Solutions at Broadridge.\n\nThis announcement marks a pivotal step in expanding the capabilities of permissionless tokenized stocks, with further developments expected as the integration progresses.\n\nOndo is now the largest platform for tokenized stocks, representing roughly 70% of the total market share, with over $800m in total value locked across 250+ tokenized stocks, with tens of thousands of asset holders. Ondo tokenized stocks are available across Solana, Ethereum, and BNB Chain, and supported by leading wallets, exchanges, custodians, and protocols including Binance, Bitget, MetaMask, Ledger, Blockchain.com, and more.\n\n*The voting capabilities of tokenholders referenced herein are rights to express preferences to the issuer of Ondo Stocks Tokens regarding voting of the shares that the issuer beneficially owns.*\n\n![](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/2679a9ba8f3c781ec705a6a3e310f0efa449db6d-1600x1539.png)"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2d:Td7a,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"In a landmark first for the industry, Ondo is live with 24/7 instant minting and redemption on tokenized U.S. stocks and ETFs. This expands access beyond Ondo's existing 24/5 minting and redemption window and 24/7 onchain transferability, enabling eligible users to mint and redeem the most popular tokenized stocks and ETFs at any time, including weekends and U.S. public holidays. Live now across Ethereum, BNB Chain, and Solana.\n\n**Real 24/7 trading for tokenized stocks is here. While others have claimed 24/7 trading, this has only ever been for CEX or DEX transfers, with actual minting and redemption limited to traditional market hours. Now, tokenized stocks are truly trading 24/7.**\n\nThe first tokenized assets available for 24/7 instant minting and redemption are SPYon, QQQon, CRCLon, NVDAon, TSLAon, and GOOGLon, six of the most actively traded tokenized stocks on the platform, with more assets to follow. \n## What’s Changing \nOndo Stocks already enables 24/7 permissionless transfers of tokenized stocks and ETFs. Eligible users can hold, transfer, and use these assets across supported wallets, exchanges, custodians, and protocols at any time, so tokenized stocks can move through the onchain economy even when traditional U.S. equity markets are closed. \n\nUntil now, however, minting and redemption has only been available 24 hours a day, five days per week (24/5), pausing over the weekend in line with traditional markets. With this upgrade, eligible users will be able to mint or redeem supported assets around the clock at the current prevailing price, creating a more continuous experience across the full tokenized stock lifecycle.\n\nWhile other platforms also enable 24/7 transfers in secondary markets such as onchain DEXs and offchain CLOBs, this is the first time that tokenized stocks and ETFs can be minted and redeemed at any time. \n## Why This Matters\nMarkets for tokenized stocks and other real-world assets are increasingly moving toward an always-on model, with investors seeking onchain exposure to traditional financial assets with the same speed, availability, and flexibility that they already experience across crypto markets.\n\nBy expanding minting and redemption for select tokenized stocks and ETFs from 24/5 to 24/7, Ondo Stocks provides users greater flexibility to enter and exit positions outside traditional U.S. market hours. This makes tokenized securities more liquid over weekends and public holidays, increasing their utility across the always-on environments where digital assets trade.\n## What’s Next\nOndo Stocks has pioneered the tokenized stock category, listing over 430 tokenized stocks and ETFs across Solana, Ethereum, and BNB Chain and becoming the first to surpass $1 billion in total value locked, more than all other tokenized stock platforms combined. \n\nOndo Stocks’ institutional-grade, always-on infrastructure has been a fundamental advantage of its model, supporting 24/7 permissionless onchain trading and enabling tokenized stocks to be deployed as collateral across platforms including Ondo Perps, Morpho, Euler, and more. Expanding to 24/7 minting and redemption builds on that foundation, further increasing the utility of tokenized stocks.\n\nStay tuned as we continue to expand our 24/7 infrastructure to support the next generation of always-on global markets. \n![](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/2679a9ba8f3c781ec705a6a3e310f0efa449db6d-1600x1539.png)"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2e:T7bd,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"We’re excited to announce a new partnership between Ondo Finance and [Franklin Templeton](https://www.franklintempleton.co.uk/), one of the largest asset managers in the world with over $1.7 trillion in AUM. \n\nTogether, we’re tokenizing 5 Franklin Templeton ETFs across growth, large cap, fixed income, equity income, and gold available through [Ondo Stocks](https://ondo.finance/ondo-stocks), the largest tokenized securities platform globally. This marks the first time that tokenized FT-managed ETFs are available onchain. \n\nThe partnership establishes a new model for distributing premier financial products globally via blockchain rails while preserving institutional standards.\n## 5 New Tokenized ETFs: Growth, Large-Cap, Fixed Income, Equity Income, and Gold\nA select range of Franklin Templeton-managed ETFs will be tokenized through Ondo Stocks:\n\n1. **Franklin Focused Growth ETF (FFOG):** Actively managed U.S. equity exposure focused on innovative and growth-oriented companies.\n2. **Franklin U.S. Large Cap Multifactor Index ETF (FLQL):** Systematic large-cap U.S. equity exposure using a multifactor approach.\n3. **Franklin Responsibly Sourced Gold ETF (FGDL):** Exposure to gold bullion sourced through responsible supply chains.\n4. **Franklin High Yield Corporate ETF (FLHY):** Exposure to U.S. high yield corporate bonds.\n5. **Franklin Income Equity Focus ETF (INCE):** An equity strategy focused on income-oriented securities.\n\nFranklin Templeton remains the asset manager of the ETFs, while Ondo provides the tokenization infrastructure and digital distribution layer.\n\nSince launching in September 2025, Ondo Stocks has quickly become the largest tokenized securities platform globally with over $700 million in total value locked, more than all other platforms combined. It has now powered over $12 billion in volume for 70K+ cumulative holders. \n\n![](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/2679a9ba8f3c781ec705a6a3e310f0efa449db6d-1600x1539.png)\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1f:[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"posts\":[{\"id\":\"0951e319-ca2f-4a23-bd56-1de08e983d70\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-06T12:30:00.000Z\",\"readLength\":\"4 min\",\"tags\":[\"Ondo Stocks\"],\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/d7b92ae960130c5940e237fd094132952a039188-1600x960.png\",\"altText\":\"Ondo, Kinexys by J.P. Morgan, Mastercard, and Ripple\",\"title\":\"Ondo, Kinexys by J.P. Morgan, Mastercard, and Ripple Complete First Cross-Border, Cross-Bank Redemption of Tokenized U.S. Treasuries \",\"body\":\"$2b\",\"isGeofenced\":false,\"routeName\":\"ondo-jpmorgan-mastercard-ripple-tokenization\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"d836f05a-e7bd-47c8-b4b7-121891b90519\",\"name\":\"Ondo Finance\",\"title\":\"Official Blog\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/721e2e3edb6efe6472b4dbad446079199a216cef-200x200.png\"},\"previewText\":\"Ondo Finance has successfully completed the first near real-time cross-border, cross-bank redemption of a tokenized U.S. Treasury fund. The pilot was conducted in collaboration with Kinexys by J.P. Morgan, Mastercard, and Ripple. \",\"backgroundColor\":\"#FFE2E2\"},{\"id\":\"04da1b91-329d-4d2b-858a-e22c7e16c1cb\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-28T05:00:00.000Z\",\"readLength\":\"2 min\",\"tags\":[\"Ondo Stocks\"],\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/662d368156d095faadb3f518b0c7b9cea3c20102-1600x960.png\",\"altText\":\"Ondo Partners With Broadridge to Bring Voting Capabilities to Tokenized Stocks\",\"title\":\"Ondo Partners With Broadridge to Bring Voting Capabilities to Tokenized Stocks\",\"body\":\"$2c\",\"isGeofenced\":false,\"routeName\":\"ondo-partners-with-broadridge-for-tokenized-stocks-voting-capabilities\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"d836f05a-e7bd-47c8-b4b7-121891b90519\",\"name\":\"Ondo Finance\",\"title\":\"Official Blog\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/721e2e3edb6efe6472b4dbad446079199a216cef-200x200.png\"},\"previewText\":\"Ondo has partnered with Broadridge Financial Solutions, which settles over $15 trillion in securities daily, to enable holders of tokenized stocks and ETFs to submit voting preferences for underlying shares.\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#E0ECFF\"},{\"id\":\"65c11dd3-9a4c-4e27-a7e7-c1bf5ccba42c\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-25T12:30:00.000Z\",\"readLength\":\"2 min\",\"tags\":[\"Ondo Stocks\"],\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/f1426f6b7c1670099734fa87d07e55d57bee898b-1600x960.png\",\"altText\":\"Ondo Launches First 24/7 Minting and Redemption for Tokenized Stocks\",\"title\":\"Ondo Launches First 24/7 Minting and Redemption for Tokenized Stocks\",\"body\":\"$2d\",\"isGeofenced\":true,\"routeName\":\"real-24-7-trading-for-tokenized-stocks\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"d836f05a-e7bd-47c8-b4b7-121891b90519\",\"name\":\"Ondo Finance\",\"title\":\"Official Blog\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/721e2e3edb6efe6472b4dbad446079199a216cef-200x200.png\"},\"previewText\":\"In a landmark first for the industry, Ondo is live with 24/7 instant minting and redemption on tokenized U.S. stocks and ETFs, including on weekends. Live now across Ethereum,  BNB Chain, and Solana.\\n\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#EBF0E7\"},{\"id\":\"85ea5d1d-1302-4b05-8bc7-b900a96854b7\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-03-25T16:35:00.000Z\",\"readLength\":\"2 min\",\"tags\":[\"Ondo Stocks\"],\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/d90eb29ed5aefaa6f7dcf835b8c06b7062347212-1200x720.png\",\"altText\":\"Ondo Tokenizes 5 Franklin Templeton ETFs for the First Time\",\"title\":\"Ondo Tokenizes 5 Franklin Templeton ETFs For the First Time\",\"body\":\"$2e\",\"isGeofenced\":true,\"routeName\":\"ondo-tokenizes-franklin-templeton-etfs\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"d836f05a-e7bd-47c8-b4b7-121891b90519\",\"name\":\"Ondo Finance\",\"title\":\"Official Blog\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8k2tqa6n/production/721e2e3edb6efe6472b4dbad446079199a216cef-200x200.png\"},\"previewText\":\"Ondo and Franklin Templeton are tokenizing 5 ETFs across growth, large cap, fixed income, equity income, and gold. This marks the first time that tokenized FT-managed ETFs are available onchain. \",\"backgroundColor\":\"#F0F0F0\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"assetsData\":{\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-20T01:51:02Z\",\"assets\":[{\"symbol\":\"usdy\",\"name\":\"Ondo US Dollar Yield\",\"priceUsd\":1.14685543,\"apy\":3.5999629806,\"tvlUsd\":{\"total\":2251490969.36,\"ethereum\":1183949088.19,\"stellar\":536157411.92,\"sei\":259021021.54,\"solana\":179755666.08,\"bsc\":52783039.08,\"sui\":1